[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2425315822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98371#issuecomment-2425315822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98371","id":2425315822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Qj2Hu","user":{"login":"IZ-sandwich","id":22223095,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjIzMDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22223095?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich","html_url":"https://github.com/IZ-sandwich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-21T00:18:21Z","updated_at":"2024-10-21T00:18:21Z","body":"My current workaround is to delete the TileMapLayer containing the scenes while saving the child scenes temporarily, and recreate the TileMapLayer and add back the child scenes before assigning the owners and saving/packing.\r\n\r\nwith the example the workaround look like this:\r\n```\r\nfunc _on_save_button_pressed() -> void:\r\n\tvar temp_array: Array[Node] = []\r\n\tfor node in tile_map_layer.get_children():\r\n\t\ttemp_array.append(node)\r\n\t\ttile_map_layer.remove_child(node)\r\n\ttest_scene.remove_child(tile_map_layer)\r\n\ttile_map_layer.queue_free()\r\n\r\n\tvar new_tile_map_layer = TileMapLayer.new()\r\n\tfor node in temp_array:\r\n\t\tnew_tile_map_layer.add_child(node)\r\n\ttest_scene.add_child(new_tile_map_layer)\r\n\r\n\tset_owner_recursive(test_scene, test_scene)\r\n\t...\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis means any properties need to be copied over for the new TileMapLayer, but I think the workaround should work for now.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2425315822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430328432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98371#issuecomment-2430328432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98371","id":2430328432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q295w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T21:17:27Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T21:17:27Z","body":"That's because you are setting owner of instantiated scenes. You should skip them in your method.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430328432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430415428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98371#issuecomment-2430415428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98371","id":2430415428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q3TJE","user":{"login":"IZ-sandwich","id":22223095,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjIzMDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22223095?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich","html_url":"https://github.com/IZ-sandwich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IZ-sandwich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T22:13:58Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T22:13:58Z","body":"That is intentional. The instantiated scenes can have updated state that I want to save, as opposed to the the default state saved within the TileMapLayer.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430415428/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430468234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98371#issuecomment-2430468234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98371","id":2430468234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q3gCK","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T23:00:15Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T23:00:15Z","body":"The TileMapLayer keeps references to its scenes internally. They are not saved, so every time the TileMapLayer is created, it assumes it's a \"fresh\" one and re-creates the scenes again. You can prevent that by disabling the layer or removing scene tiles, then only your copies will remain.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430468234/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2434193